#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gimp"
msgstr "Instalação do Gimp"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If upgrading from a previous Gimp-3 installation, as the &root; user, remove"
" some files and directories from the old installation or the build system "
"may mistakenly pick them up, causing a build failure:"
msgstr ""
"Se atualizar a partir de uma instalação anterior do Gimp-3, como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;, remova alguns arquivos e diretórios da instalação antiga "
"ou o sistema de construção pode pegá-los erroneamente, causando uma falha de"
" construção:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:190
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm -rf /usr/{lib,share}/gimp/3.0 &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -f  /usr/share/gir-1.0/Gimp-3.0.gir &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -f  /usr/lib/girepository-1.0/Gimp-3.0.typelib &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -f  /usr/lib/libgimp*-3.0.so*</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -rf /usr/{lib,share}/gimp/3.0 &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -f  /usr/share/gir-1.0/Gimp-3.0.gir &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -f  /usr/lib/girepository-1.0/Gimp-3.0.typelib &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -f  /usr/lib/libgimp*-3.0.so*</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:196
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Gimp</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Gimp</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:200
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir gimp-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    gimp-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -D headless-tests=disabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir gimp-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    gimp-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -D headless-tests=disabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results (requires a terminal in a graphical environment)  issue:"
" <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados (exige um terminal em um ambiente gráfico) emita: "
"<command>ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:220
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gimp-Help"
msgstr "Instalação do Gimp-Help"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename>gimp-help</filename> tarball contains images and English text "
"help for help files, together with translations.  If you wish to install "
"local copies of the help files to read offline, unpack the gimp-help tarball"
" and change into the root of the newly created source tree."
msgstr ""
"O tarball <filename>gimp-help</filename> contém imagens e texto de ajuda em "
"inglês para arquivos de ajuda, juntamente com traduções. Se você desejar "
"instalar cópias locais dos arquivos de ajuda para ler offline, desempacote o"
" tarball gimp-help e mude para a raiz da árvore do fonte recém-criada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:238
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../../gimp-help-&gimp-help-version;.tar.bz2 &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd gimp-help-&gimp-help-version;\n"
"\n"
"ALL_LINGUAS=&quot;ca cs da de en en_GB es fa fr hr ko lt nl nn pt pt_BR ro sl sv uk zh_CN&quot; \\\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../../gimp-help-&gimp-help-version;.tar.bz2 &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd gimp-help-&gimp-help-version;\n"
"\n"
"ALL_LINGUAS=&quot;ca cs da de en en_GB es fa fr hr ko lt nl nn pt pt_BR ro sl sv uk zh_CN&quot; \\\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove from <envar>ALL_LINGUAS</envar> the codes for any languages which you"
" do not wish to install. Alternatively, remove the line starting with "
"<envar>ALL_LINGUAS</envar>, if you wish to build all languages."
msgstr ""
"Remova de <envar>ALL_LINGUAS</envar> os códigos de quaisquer idiomas que "
"você não desejar instalar. Alternativamente, remova a linha que começa com "
"<envar>ALL_LINGUAS</envar>, se desejar construir todos os idiomas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:251
#, xml-text
msgid "Now build the help files:"
msgstr "Agora construa os arquivos de ajuda:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:254
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Issue the following commands as the &root; user to install the help files:"
msgstr ""
"Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &root; para instalar os "
"arquivos de ajuda:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:260
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -R root:root /usr/share/gimp/3.0/help</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown -R root:root /usr/share/gimp/3.0/help</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#.  xvfb-run is referred by the mutter package
#.       for testing.  But why the GIMP test doesn't like it on the local
#.       machine?  The upstream CI uses it anyway.  I really don't
#.       know :(.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:269
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D headless-tests=disabled</parameter>: This switch disables "
"using <command>xvfb-run</command> for running the tests.  Without this "
"switch, many tests fail if <command>xvfb-run</command> has been installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D headless-tests=disabled</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"usar <command>xvfb-run</command> para executar os testes. Sem essa chave, "
"muitos testes falham se <command>xvfb-run</command> tiver sido instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>ALL_LINGUAS=&quot;ca cs da de en en_GB es fa...&quot;</envar>: by "
"default, the help files will be rendered in all the available languages.  "
"Remove the codes of any languages you do not wish to build."
msgstr ""
"<envar>ALL_LINGUAS=&quot;ca cs da de en en_GB es fa...&quot;</envar>: por "
"padrão, os arquivos de ajuda serão renderizados em todos os idiomas "
"disponíveis. Remova os códigos de quaisquer idiomas que você não desejar "
"construir."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:287
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring The Gimp"
msgstr "Configurando o Gimp"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gimp.xml:293
#, xml-text
